  BUILD NOTE (2026-07-06, M8) — the formerly gated middle, now built to the storyboard with
  claim discipline intact:
    20  structural levy lesson: LevyLesson keeps trading off and follows the proportional
        collection, common pool, equal return, and net result as separate reversible states.
